# Home hero

Desktop (`≥768px`): one full-bleed slide, height `--shell-banner-height` (320px), width 1300px column, arrows `--shell-arrow-size`.

Mobile (`max-width: 767px`):

- Assets in `assets/images/banners/mobile/` are **square (1:1)**. Ratio token: `--shell-home-banner-ratio-mobile`.
- Centered slide with side peek `--shell-hero-peek` (`--space-8`). Keep prev/next arrows.
- Show the full art: `object-fit: contain`. Do not use `cover` or `--shell-banner-ratio-mobile` (that 1080/867 box crops top/bottom).
- Active slide: 2px inset `--color-primary`. Dots: `--shell-hero-dot`, active `--color-primary`, idle `color-mix` of primary into `--color-bg`.
- CSS: [`components/hero/hero.css`](components/hero/hero.css). After HTML template edits run `node scripts/build-fragments.js`.
